{"id":"8e9ab8b3f0cb5f0a","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-membership.md","title":"Membership","display":"df-membership — Membership","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-membership","aliases":["58-df-membership","Membership"],"display":"df-membership — Membership","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-element.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-membership"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-membership</span><span>Membership</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-membership — Membership"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40dfd40839597962\" href=\"?note=40dfd40839597962\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-element.md\">../batch01/58-df-element.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Element}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Element}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40dfd40839597962\" href=\"?note=40dfd40839597962\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-element.md\">../batch01/58-df-element.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementOf}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementOf}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}membership} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElementOf}_S(x,y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Element}_S(x,y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}membership} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElementOf}_S(x,y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Element}_S(x,y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Membership <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>: primitive relation of set theory; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in y\">\\(x \\in y\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> is element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span></li>\n<li>Well-foundedness of membership is governed by the axiom of foundation.</li>\n<li>Hereditarily finite: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"HF = \\{x : |\\operatorname{TC}(x)| &lt; \\omega\\}\">\\(HF = \\{x : |\\operatorname{TC}(x)| &lt; \\omega\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Reflection: properties of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> reflected in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>-structure replicates at lower levels</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-element.md","status":"resolved","id":"40dfd40839597962","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-element.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-element.md","status":"resolved","id":"40dfd40839597962","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Element}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-element.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Element}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementOf}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}membership} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElementOf}_S(x,y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Element}_S(x,y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in y","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"HF = \\{x : |\\operatorname{TC}(x)| < \\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false}],"bytes":924,"backlinks":[{"id":"d35b78cf8312c12b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-838","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-membership.md|58-df-membership]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["40dfd40839597962"]}